  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are surrounded by invisible necrotic spores that are harmless until you unleash them. When a creature you can see moves into a space within 10 feet of you or starts its turn there, you can take a Reaction to deal 1d4 Necrotic damage to it unless it succeeds on a Constitution saving throw against your spell save DC. The damage increases to 1d6 at Druid level 6, 1d8 at level 10, and 1d10 at level 14.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-58Jben6EGDqQwUgq\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>With Symbiotic Entity, roll the die twice (add the second die yourself).</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
